Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:48.66,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:54.15,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:55.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:02.32,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是从Cure Noble那继承的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.67,0:16:04.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,确实强
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.27,0:16:14.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,只是还不如知识宫殿中所记录的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.37,0:16:23.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们的所爱 希望我们这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:27.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你是为了女帝在战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.11,0:16:29.44,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:32.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,请告诉我 她遇到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.01,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:37.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量 召唤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:47.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:49.54,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴兽？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.95,0:16:51.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,以量换质？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:53.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:56.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:57.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:16:58.57,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:16:59.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:02.63,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:05.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是你的对手吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:06.27,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.43,0:17:07.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:08.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:08.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.12,0:17:09.65,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.69,0:17:12.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.91,0:17:14.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:15.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.65,0:17:17.71,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,还是第一次遇到5对5
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:19.85,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:22.47,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:26.38,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,粉碎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闪...闪亮模式！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把持住！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可...可是队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶住 肯定有我们出手的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.07,0:18:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他们也早不是 能被区区乱暴兽击败的Precure了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.50,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,一招解决掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.00,0:18:03.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.99,0:18:07.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.21,0:18:08.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:10.51,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.64,0:18:14.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.08,0:18:15.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.97,0:18:16.95,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:18.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:20.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄气阔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:23.32,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,破晓终结！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:23.32,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Magic Hours End！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:28.03,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.46,0:18:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:32.56,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,就在紧要关头... 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.72,0:18:33.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:39.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,太慢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:41.09,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.55,0:18:50.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,两... 两个人就这威力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.86,0:18:52.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,没有全力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.89,0:18:55.63,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是为了打倒你而战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.77,0:19:00.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的力量是保护众人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.93,0:19:04.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量的差距竟有如此之大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:08.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,一... 一人之下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:11.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,居然到这个地步了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.72,0:19:15.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是不是很不妙啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:17.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我封闭了你们的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:21.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,白费力气 伙伴们马上就会来救...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:23.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,不会给你们时间的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:28.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,至少要带着你们两个一起上路
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:31.46,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,为了女帝陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:34.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,住手 一人之下！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:46.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:47.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:57.02,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,紫色的...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:20:00.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:06.61,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:14.81,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,能从暗塌谷能量下 保护大家的招数
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.99,0:20:16.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,神威幕纱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.99,0:20:16.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Majestic Veil
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.10,0:20:18.69,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:33.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,别费劲了 那种治疗的招数对我不起效果的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:39.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝陛下 这是我的最后一课了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.62,0:20:42.57,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量即是一切
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.93,0:20:47.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,所以无力者的下场 便是如此凄惨凄凉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:53.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是有更强的力量 就能保护好所爱的你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:59.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 女帝陛下...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.65,0:21:06.06,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.73,0:21:10.75,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要夺走多少我的所爱 才满意啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.90,0:21:16.54,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:27.63,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝·暗塌谷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:34.07,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你要是愿意和我们对话的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.28,0:21:37.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可能也不至于发生这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:40.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我就讲给你们听
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:46.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,300前暗塌谷帝国和蓝天大地缔结了和平条约
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:51.70,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 Cure Noble却背叛了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:53.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,杀害了我父皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.09,0:21:59.62,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.40,0:22:03.60,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的绝不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.45,0:22:08.96,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.45,0:22:08.96,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1090,970)}威爱愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:12.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 要和我一起跳哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.57,0:23:48.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝 快住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.52,0:23:51.23,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,要切割暗塌谷能量与女帝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.39,0:23:52.10,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.25,0:23:53.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不好！保护城市的护盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.45,0:23:57.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我来... 我们来保护！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:24:00.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.79,0:24:00.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.46,0:24:03.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,守护吧英雄！我们的城市！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.12,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.78,0:24:42.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 有新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.43,0:24:46.05,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,汪Q要开展对暗号活动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.46,0:24:49.39,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这次的变身道具是精彩粉盒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.87,0:24:52.26,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,只要去商店里对暗号！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.45,0:24:56.29,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,就能得到和精彩粉盒外观一样的汪Q出道粉盒（纸质玩具）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.83,0:24:59.13,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你也变身成Precure吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.89,0:25:02.95,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,暗号是“汪Q” 是“汪Q”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.13,0:25:07.41,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,还有购买精彩粉盒就送友谊蝴蝶结的活动哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.62,0:25:09.59,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,记得2月3日去商店逛逛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.39,0:01:53.59,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.59,0:01:59.19,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:04.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.74,0:02:12.44,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:17.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:21.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:23.32,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:27.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.22,0:02:32.21,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.31,0:02:38.76,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:42.72,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:46.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:46.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:48.16,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.55,0:02:48.16,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.49,0:02:53.87,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.08,0:02:58.52,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:03.84,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:08.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:11.39,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:19.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
